sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Founder as C02 Founder
  participant API as C05 API + C12 Atlas
  participant Worker as C06 Durable worker
  participant Harness as C07/08 Retrieval + harness
  participant Docs as C09/10 Validation + documents
  actor Lawyer as C03 Lawyer
  participant Mail as C13/14 Email
  Note over API,Worker: D01/D05/D06 · user.signed_up → durable event + job, duplicate is deduplicated
  API-->>Worker: D06 A · claim leased job with fence
  Worker->>Harness: D07 S · pin corpus, facts and harness v1, retrieve context
  Worker->>Docs: K-EVAL-01 S · validate context readiness before assessment
  Docs-->>Worker: V03 APPLICABILITY_BUNDLE_MISSING
  Worker->>Harness: K-EVAL-02 S · repair: select same available pinned CA law and facts
  Harness-->>Worker: context.snapshot_pinned: complete applicability bundle
  Worker->>Harness: D09 S · assess with complete context
  Harness-->>Worker: assessment.completed: covered / not_covered / needs_information
  alt Missing facts
    Worker-->>Founder: D17 A · request information, persisted needs_information
    Founder->>API: D04 H/S · attributed fact correction
    API-->>Worker: company.context_updated, re-assess
  else Not covered, no other change identified
    Worker->>API: D29 D · closed_no_change with evidence
  else Covered synthetic main demo
    Worker->>Harness: D09 S · draft clause changes against immutable base
    Harness->>Docs: D11 S · create_change_proposal
    Worker->>Docs: D12 S · validate_proposal
    Docs-->>Worker: validation.failed: CITATION_SPAN_MISMATCH (seeded draft-output fault)
    Worker->>Harness: K-EVAL-02 S · repair citation against SAME pinned source
    Harness->>Docs: D11 S · new immutable corrected candidate revision
    Worker->>Docs: D12 S · full validation after output repair
    Docs-->>Worker: validation.passed, exact review_bundle_id/hash
    Note over Worker,Docs: Readiness repair + output repair share max TWO total actions. No cap reset.
    Worker-->>Mail: D17 A · founder review request
    Founder->>API: D02/D04 H/S · viewed or reviewed activity
    opt Founder requests changes
      Founder->>API: D15 H/S · attributed feedback
      API-->>Worker: review.changes_requested → new revision → validation → founder
    end
    Founder->>API: D15 H/S · explicit approve exact review bundle
    API-->>Worker: review.founder_approved
    Worker-->>Mail: D17 A · lawyer review request for same bundle
    Mail-->>Lawyer: D18 S · review link, delivery state separate
    opt Lawyer requests changes
      Lawyer->>API: D15 H/S · requested document/legal changes
      API-->>Worker: New material invalidates both gates, validate then founder again
    end
    Lawyer->>API: D15 H/S · explicit approve same current bundle
    API-->>Worker: review.lawyer_approved
    Worker->>Docs: D28 S · atomic finalization check and current pointer update
    Docs->>API: D16 D · document.finalized, no public publication
    Worker-->>Mail: D17 A · final status/document link
  end
  Note over API,Mail: Email retries do not regenerate drafts or grant approvals. Reject stale decisions atomically.
